#. copy/eyebrow
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/eyebrow"
msgid "KOURINDOU × MISTY LAKE LIBRARY"
msgstr "KOURINDOU × MISTY LAKE LIBRARY"

#. copy/title
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/title"
msgid "Outside World Drift-Object Appraisal Office"
msgstr "外界漂流物鑑定所"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"A name, an original purpose, and a useful life in Gensokyo are three "
"different questions. Kourindou sees names, the library keeps evidence, and "
"the kappa stare at ports. If the object objects, that enters the file too."
msgstr "名称、元の用途、幻想郷で今何に使うかは別の問い。香霖堂は名を見て、図書館は証拠を残し、河童は端子を見つめる。物が異議を唱えれば、それも記録する。"

