msgid "Send to the four-party appraisal meeting"
msgstr "四者鑑定会へ送る"

#. copy/incomplete
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incomplete"
msgid ""
"The file cannot close: use at least two evidence items and one test, then "
"complete original use, new use, destination, and agency observation."
msgstr "終結不可：証拠二件、試験一件以上と、元用途・新用途・移管先・意思観察を入力してください。"

#. copy/saved
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/saved"
msgid "The appraisal file is bound; My TU and the campus event ledger received copies."
msgstr "鑑定記録を綴じ、My TU と学内事象帳にも副本を送りました。"

#. copy/cleared
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/cleared"
msgid "The bench is clear. Previous case files were not discarded."
msgstr "机を片付けました。過去記録は捨てていません。"

#. copy/supported
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/supported"
